<title>USA: Sao Tome evaluation time table accelerated.</title>
<headline>Sao Tome evaluation time table accelerated.</headline>
<dateline>BROUSSARD, La. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Remediation Holding Corp said Friday favorable information and data acquired from the Gulf of Guinea has accelerated the company's time table for the evaluation of the Democratic Republic of Sao Tome and Principe's potential as a commercial petroleum producing province.</p>
<p>The company said it is now negotiating with Nabor Industries Inc's drilling unit as the contractor for the C.O.S.T. (Continental Offshore Strategraphic Test) project.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
